'''Pokémon Pocket Comics: Legendary Pokémon''' (Japanese: '''{{tt|爆笑4コマ 伝説のポケモンをさがせ!!|Bakusho 4Koma Denetsu No Pokemon O Sagase!!}}''' ''Laughter 4Koma Search for Legendary Pokémon!!'') is a [[Pokémon 4Koma]] {{pkmn|manga}} created by [[Santa Harukaze]].

==Publications==
{{publications/h|Unova}}
