{{publications|cover=Pokémon Pocket Comics Legendary Pokémon US cover.png|edition=First|country=United States|company=VIZ Media|date=October 6, 2015|ISBN=1421581280}}
|}

==Content==
The manga is split into two different stories, each about 90 pages long. 

Each story also includes three 6-8 page mini-breaks that feature a short 1-2 page comic about a Pokémon. 

Quizzes also make a return in both mini-breaks and the manga pages. However the manga page quizzes usually ask for specific attributes about Pokémon such as "What does {{p|Lombre}} eat" or "Where does {{p|Trubbish}} dwell". While the mini-break quizzes are more picture oriented, such as "Match the correct tail with the correct Pokémon" or "Match the correct head with the correct Pokémon".

==Plot==
Story 1 is about {{p|Oshawott}} and his friends trying to cheer up {{p|Pikachu}} by finding the legendary joke.

Story 2 is about Oshawott and {{p|Whismur}} trying to find the right [[Legendary Pokémon]] and the legendary joke.

